Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第17集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:06.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚 旧金山）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 麦迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Maddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 呃 我并不想扫你的兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I, uh, hate to pull you away…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你得和我一起回趟办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm gonna need you to come back to the office with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 是啊 因为我要在天亮前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? Yeah, turns out I gotta file…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把计算机里的档案整理好 - 半夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …those docs by midnight and-Midnight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你… 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm gonna need you to, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这没用 是吧？- 不 并没有 内森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't working at all, is it? - No, it's not, Nate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我多喝了几杯 我开不了车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I've had a couple. I shouldn't really drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能送我回去吗 - 我已经给你叫了车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you just give me a lift-? - I already called you a cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你经常遇到这种事？- 只有在以Y字结尾的日子才会有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm, that happen a lot? - Only on the days that end with a Y.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了 警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is, detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬得真够狠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a pretty nasty bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是什么咬的他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what bit him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不大确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't quite determined that just yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 医生 不作记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, doc, off the record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 绝对不能记录在案 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, way, way off the record. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没有猜错的话 我觉得这个家伙是被狼袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know better, I'd say the guy was attacked by a wolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是动物园丢了一只大灰狼 不然我会说是美洲嚣犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unless the zoo is missing one of their lobos, I'm going with pit bull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢我的工作 - 是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like my job. - Yeah, I hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事 这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing. This guy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的心脏是不是没了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}was his heart missing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你怎么知道？我的报告还没写完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how did you know that? I haven't even finished my report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个律师 是这里头一个没有心脏的死人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This lawyer guy the first heart-free corpse in town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,头一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年也有几个女人先后失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the past year, several women have gone missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来在水湾发现了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their bodies all washed up later in the bay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,被腐蚀的太严重 无法鉴别细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}too deteriorated to draw firm conclusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但都没有心脏 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But no hearts? - No hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们都是在亨特地段附近工作的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}All hookers working at Hunter's Point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方想把这些事保持低调 但他们找的是连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops are trying to keep things under wrap. They're looking for a serial killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在月圆之时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the lunar cycle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 每个月 每一次谋杀都发生在满月的那周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all the murders happened in the week leading up to the full moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这周就是 - 被害的是这个律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which is this week, right? - Hence the lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你能别那么幸灾乐祸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, could you be a bigger geek about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但这种白天是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man, but what about a human by day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上变成杀人机器的怪物 你不明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a freak animal killing machine by moonlight don't you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血狼人可都是变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, werewolves are badass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,从小到大我们连一只都没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen one since we were kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 万事通 你知道么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sparky, and you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.75,0:05:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等我们杀了它 我们可以去迪斯尼 - 知道最棒的是什么么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After we kill it, we can go to Disneyland. - Know what the best part is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经知道了消灭这些东西的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already know how to bring these suckers down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要这些小家伙穿透他们心脏就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these bad boys right to the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们接下来怎么做？- 和发现尸体的女孩聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's our next move? - Talk to the girl who found the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 我已经做过笔录了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. I already gave my statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些事有待核实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yeah, well, we just need to verify a few things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的邻居格伦 格伦 这位是警长…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my neighbor, Glen. Glen, this is detective-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪斯 还有但丁警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Landis. And Detective Dante.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我看我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guess I'll leave you to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢你的菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thanks for the casserole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑的真周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how thoughtful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么需要尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call if you need anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人挺不错 他过来看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sweet. He came over to check on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have-Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定受了很大惊吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be pretty shaken up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是内森·马利根的助理吧？- 是啊 2年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were Nate Mulligan's assistant, right? - For two years, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很了解他这个人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you knew all about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能比他自己还要了解 内森他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably knew more about him than he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate was-He was nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 其实没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But? - Nothing really, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一喝多了 就容易随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a few scotches and started hitting on anyone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,找人搭讪 你了解那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a five-mile radius. You know the type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我很了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I do, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有什么仇人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he have any enemies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？当然 看起来就是动物袭击造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? It sure looked like an animal attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们只是想排除一切可能性 有人怨恨他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Yeah, we're just covering all the bases. Anyone that might've had a beef with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 前客户 或者前… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Former client, an ex? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点尴尬 我的前男友 库尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is embarrassing but my ex-boyfriend, Kurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.55,0:06:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他姓什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt have a last name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,米勒 我们分手之后 他就疯疯癫癫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mueller. After we broke up, he went kind of nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's kind of been stalking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我和内森之间有私情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got it in his head that something was going on between Nate and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他去过我的办公室 - 然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He showed up at my office. - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特找到内森 打了他 然后被保安制止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kurt got into it with Nate. Threw a punch before security grabbed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很走运 没被开除 - 你最后一次见到库尔特是什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was lucky to keep my job. - When was the last time you saw Kurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天前的晚上 实际上 就是内森死的那天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few nights ago. Actually, the night Nate died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在酒吧喝酒 然后库尔特来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were grabbing drinks at this bar and Kurt showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？- 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 他好像在盯着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like he was watching me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}he scares me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,前男友是个跟踪狂 他恨那个老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stalker ex-boyfriend? He hates the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那晚他也在那儿 - 你觉得他就是我们要找的狼人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And he was there that night. - You think he's our dog-faced boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 更糟的我们都遇过 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've had worse. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去查查库尔特吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we pay Kurt a visit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有发现吗？- 除了剩饭就是餐盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything? - Nothing but leftovers and a six pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看冷冻箱里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the freezer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准儿在哈根达斯什么的后面 能找到人的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's some human hearts behind the H?agen-Dazs or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在那吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is somebody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call 911.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 库尔特越来越像我们要找的狼人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say Kurt's looking more and more like our Cujo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在这附近 我们最好去看看麦迪逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if he's out here, we better check on Madison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了？- 警方调查 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Police business, Glen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能私下谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we should talk privately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特有没有来过这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Kurt been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算吧 到底是有还是没有？他昨晚在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What exactly does "not exactly" mean? Well, he was outside last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只是看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,望着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:10:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做了什么事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he done something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不大清楚 - 可能什么事都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not really sure. It's probably nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 我们不想冒任何风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we just don't wanna take any chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们中的一人应该留下和你在一起 以防他过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, one of us should probably stay here with you, just in case he stops by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪儿上班？- 他自己有家汽车修理厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where does he work? - He owns a body shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我们一个地址吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind grabbing that address for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 你去吧 我留下 - 算了吧 你去追踪那个变态前男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. You go, I'll stay. - Forget that. You go after the creepy ex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要在这里陪美女 - 为什么总是你和女孩在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll hang here with the hot chick. - Why do you always hang with the girls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我比你年长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 我们用老办法解决这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Screw that. We settle this the old-fashioned way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你总是出剪刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, always with the scissors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 得了 三局两胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Shut up. Two out of three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 搞定它 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God! - Bundle up out there, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想去沙发那坐吗？- 不 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, do you wanna sit on the couch? - No. No, no, I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里更舒服一些 - 呃 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's more comfortable. - Aw, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我还是到沙发上坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I think I will sit on that couch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 你正在她沙发上坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. You're sitting on her couch like a stiff…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想着怎么找点话题开场 - 你找到库尔特了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …trying to think of something to say. - You find Kurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他整周都在上班 但是由于我很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't been at work. But because I'm good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:13:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 非常 非常强 我知道他可能在哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I mean really, really good, I got a line on where he might be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她穿的什么？- 再见 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's she wearing? - Bye, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不爱他 你想做的就是回到我身边…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't love him. All you wanna do is get back at me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take away everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是否曾经在你的大脑中穿行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it ever run through your thick brain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有的事都是关于你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that not everything is about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看见了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw that. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is the deal:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家 我的电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house, my TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我决定看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never get to watch my show…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so suck it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 金德尔嫁给了伊桑的爸爸 只是为了报复他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so Kendall married Ethan's father just to get back at him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在得到了所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. And now she's set to inherit all the casinos…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本属于伊桑的赌场 真是个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …that were supposed to go to Ethan. - What a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 你入戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admit it, you're hooked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我… 我才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I…I wouldn't say I'm hooked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问你个问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点 有点私人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's-It's a little personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连我所有的内衣都见识过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen my entire underwear collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,问吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你的房子里全是书 你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're clearly smart. I mean, your house is full of great books, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.45,0:14:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还很独立 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and you're independent. - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会和库尔特在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing with Kurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.63,0:14:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 不是说他是这样介绍自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like he introduced himself, like:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你好 我占有欲极强 我还喜欢打人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hi, I'm possessive and controlling, and I like to punch people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「能当我女朋友吗？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna be my girlfriend?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我想我们都会犯错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I guess we all make mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他都被警察通缉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, mine's wanted by the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想知道我为什么和他在一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know why I stayed with him? Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很没有安全感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was too insecure to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find that hard to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看起来不像那个类型的 - 是啊 发生了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, you don't really seem like the type. - Yeah, well, some stuff happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变了生活方式 也改变了自己 我觉得变得更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life changed. I changed for the better, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了？- 发生了一件事 我被打劫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Well, for one thing, I got mugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是件好事儿？- 我知道 听起来很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's supposed to be a good thing? - I know. It sounds strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会我 那真的让我很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't get me wrong, it rattled me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我突然醒悟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then it hit me:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是要一直自我怜悯 还是去把握自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could keep feeling sorry for myself, or I could take control of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了后者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose the latter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后我做的第一件事就是让库尔特离开 - 做的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- First thing I did was tell Kurt he had to go. - Smart move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有事就此明了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything else just opened up, blossomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all been wonderful, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家认为在暴力事件中随机受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't everybody think being a victim of random violence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是件好事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the best thing that ever happened to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不尽然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha. Yeah, not so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,像那种不一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unusual like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不正常？- 不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …unusual? - No. No. No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unusual like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人难忘 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - I found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 别放过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Don't take your eyes off him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我的眼睛都粘在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. My eyes are glued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sammy, I gotta let you go. I, uh-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我可不想错过任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna miss anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna turn in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah. Well, I'll be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道… 如果你听见什么或者醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? If you hear anything-I mean, if you wake up, just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就喊我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 你还好吗？- 没事 至少我还有意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.You okay? - Now that I'm conscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人打晕了我 萨姆 是麦迪逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The werewolf knocked me out. Sam, it's Madison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 牢牢地盯着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, awesome job of keeping an eye on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我一直在这儿 她现在在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.I've been here the whole time. She's in bed, asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时前她可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she wasn't an hour ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她的右臂 我用银刀刺了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check her right arm below her elbow. I nicked her with a silver knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的睡衣在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, where are my pajamas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪儿也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're psychotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还骗我是警察 天 我怎么这么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole "I'm a cop" trip. God, I am so stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们两个都跟自己说的不一样 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess neither of us are who we said we were, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you're sick, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在胡思乱想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're imagining things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怪物是不存在的 - 你知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Monsters don't exist, not really. - You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,少装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有装\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.11,0:20:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是狼人 那种东西根本不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a werewolf. There is no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是假的好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's made up, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是真的 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not real. You know they're not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是？那这伤口从哪儿来的？- 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? Then where did that come from? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 天啊 你需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, God, you need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 别做会让你后悔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't do something that you're gonna regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你想的那种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not what you think I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头感觉好极了 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head feels great, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说不知道我说的是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she has no idea what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在骗人 - 也许吧 也许她真的不知道自己是狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's lying. - Maybe she doesn't know she's changing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许变成狼人的时候 她就失去了意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe when the creature takes over, she blacks out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像个惹火的绿巨人？老弟 她杀了她老板和前男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a really hot Incredible Hulk? She ganked her boss and her ex-boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来可不像是没有意识 - 可如果是真的呢 迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That doesn't sound rash and unconscious. - But what if it was?Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她大脑里狼人的部分 把那两个人当成威胁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if some animal part of her brain saw those guys as threats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 那个警察肯定也是 - 你什么时候变成狗语者了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The cop too. - Are you the dog whisperer now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 她眼睛里有某种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. There was something in her eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 她在杀人 - 可如果她不能控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, she's killing people. - But if she has no control-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当然不能控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly, she can't control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算她说的是真话 也没什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's telling the truth, it won't change anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会对一个什么都不知道的女孩开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not putting a bullet through some girl's chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是怪物 你同情她？- 也许我只是理解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's a monster and you're feeling sorry? - Maybe I understand her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有别的办法完成这活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.There might be another way we can get the job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不用杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}done without having to waste her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是跟我想到一起去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you thinking what I think you're thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's theory:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果杀了咬你的狼人 切断血脉源 也许就能解除变狼朮\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lycanthropy might have a cure if you kill the werewolf who bit you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.97,0:21:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许就能 - 就是鬼才知道的意思 谁知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …severing the bloodline. - Might have a cure.Meaning who knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 值得一试 - 我们根本不知道从何开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's worth a shot. - We don't know where to start looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬了她的那狗东西 也许是任何人 可能在任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The puppy that bit her could be anyone, anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许已经过了好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have been years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.19,0:22:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么时候被打劫的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When were you mugged?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 这很重要 回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. It's important, all right? Just answer the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约一个月以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a month ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到犯人了么？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see the guy? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他从后面抓住我 - 他是不是咬了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grabbed me from behind. - Did he bite you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.47,0:22:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿？- 在脖子后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - On the back of my neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是个爱的齿痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was just a love bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.49,0:22:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 比那更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, that could have been a lot worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.57,0:22:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是在哪儿被袭击的？- 从一个朋友那里回家的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where were you at the time? - Walking home from a friend's loft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,离亨特地段不远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too far from Hunter's Point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.96,0:23:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那些凶杀发生地一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same place where those other murders happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.34,0:23:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里肯定就是狼人的狩猎场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, it's a werewolf's hunting grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.09,0:23:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 但今晚它不一定会去那儿 - 今天正是月圆之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe.That doesn't mean it'll be out tonight. - It's the right time in the lunar cycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.18,0:23:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道希望不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a long shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还忘了另一件事 麦迪可能很快就会变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're forgetting something. Maddy's probably gonna turn soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,总不能放她出去随便吃人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just let her take off to an all-you-can-eat buffet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.64,0:23:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会和她呆在一起 - 如果她挣脱了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll stay with her. - And if she busts loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.15,0:23:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆？- 我会动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.23,0:23:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 我会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - I'll shoot her, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.53,0:23:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 迪恩 我要你去那里 至少去找找那个狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, I need you to go out there. At least go look for the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 求你了 我们能救这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, please. We can save this girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.71,0:23:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.47,0:23:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.20,0:24:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.08,0:24:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.04,0:24:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道 你决不会相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also know that there's no way in hell you're gonna believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我这么做… 是因为我想要帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm doing this because I'm trying to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想骗你 我们并不想搞成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lie. The odds aren't exactly in our favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.26,0:24:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果能像我祈祷的一样顺利…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if this goes the way I pray it does…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.02,0:24:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll untie you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.52,0:24:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会走出这扇门 永远不再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll walk out that door and I'll never come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.11,0:24:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会继续过你的生活…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll live the rest of your life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只是一段不愉快的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll just be a bad memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.71,0:26:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't mention it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.03,0:27:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.91,0:27:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.16,0:27:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh. Help-Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.71,0:27:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.17,0:27:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 格伦 别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, easy, Glen. Just take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.82,0:27:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be over now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.24,0:27:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会再见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never see me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.11,0:28:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 有点悲惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sort of sad, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦根本不知道出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen had no clue what was going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.03,0:28:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他为什么不杀了麦迪逊 而是把她变成同类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think he turned Madison, instead of just killing her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.33,0:28:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.83,0:28:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他看起来对她有点意思 - 也可能是因为他本性善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He kind of seemed to have a thing for her. - Maybe his primal instinct did too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.33,0:28:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是某种强烈的繁殖行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he was looking for a little hot breeding action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.96,0:28:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 类似那种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.55,0:28:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.88,0:28:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后什么？- 说到麦迪逊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what? - Speaking of Madison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 行了 - 什么行了 你喜欢她 也许 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, whatever. - Don't whatever me. You liked her. Maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 她觉得我是个彻底的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, she thought I was a stark raving lunatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.47,0:28:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你救了她的命 - 可她不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You saved her life. - Yeah, but she doesn't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.14,0:28:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你们的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a stakeout…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.85,0:28:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来监视可有点太显眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your car's a bit conspicuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:29:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们还在这儿干吗？- 说实话？呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you still doing here? - Honestly? Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.15,0:29:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你今晚应该不会变成狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pretty sure you're not gonna turn tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.40,0:29:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们想百分百的确定 所以 你知道 我们就… 在盯梢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we gotta be 100 percent. So, you know, we're lurking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.99,0:29:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道这很疯狂 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I know this sounds crazy…Sure does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.67,0:29:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 要是要等结果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we're gonna wait it out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.13,0:29:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许咱们应该一起等\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might as well do it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.30,0:29:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的是真的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were telling the truth, weren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所做的 都是为了救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did, it was to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 我干了那么多可怕的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I did all those horrible things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.53,0:29:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在变成狼人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.86,0:29:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:30:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们什么时候能确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when will we know for sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.25,0:30:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 月亮出来的时候？- 我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moonrise? No, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.25,0:30:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上你是半夜时变的身 我觉得应该等到日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned middle of the night last night. I think we gotta hang in until sunup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.68,0:30:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来得消磨好长一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like we got ourselves a few hours to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩扑克嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poker, anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.42,0:30:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你们继续聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you guys talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.10,0:31:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这是不是说明没事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does? Does this mean it worked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.27,0:31:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.94,0:31:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.28,0:31:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.87,0:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 迪恩 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Dean. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.33,0:31:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't mention it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.42,0:31:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.46,0:31:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 我正好要回旅店\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm just gonna head back to the hotel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.17,0:31:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看付费频道什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watch some pay-per-view or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.02,0:31:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真识相\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was smooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.36,0:31:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是觉得你会和我上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, he thinks you're gonna get laid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.32,0:31:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧 我… - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I… - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.03,0:31:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.41,0:31:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我吓坏你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I scared the crap out of you, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.95,0:32:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 我是说 - 我把你捆在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, I tied you to a chair. - That's right up there with me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.00,0:32:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我把你的脸都抓伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}scratching up your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.17,0:32:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just no way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到原来了 你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could go back, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.34,0:32:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到一切开始之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.18,0:32:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.43,0:32:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just no way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.26,0:34:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她 她变身了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She turned. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't grab her in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.97,0:34:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到她 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find her, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.18,0:34:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经打电话问了鲍比 他不知道别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already called Bobby. He doesn't know anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.68,0:34:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了切断血脉源不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except, he knew severing the bloodline wouldn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.48,0:34:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都说是没办法复原的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most everyone says it's impossible to reverse it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.65,0:34:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和她一起的时候怎么没变？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come she didn't turn when we were with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.65,0:34:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 你和她上床 然后她就变成狼人逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - You put her to bed, then she wolfed out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.74,0:34:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许要在睡着的时候才会变 - 这还有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe she's gotta be asleep to turn? - What does it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法救救她 也许漏掉了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find some way to help her. Some legend we missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们认识的人会不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was, someone we know would've known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.91,0:34:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就更仔细的找 直到找到为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, we have to look harder until we find something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.83,0:34:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我不觉得咱们还有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I don't think we got a choice here anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.33,0:34:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 她是个好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I hate to say it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.63,0:34:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她有一部分是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's sweet, but part is-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.96,0:34:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邪恶的？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Evil? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.17,0:34:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也是这么说我的 迪恩 就是说 你不会杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they say about me, Dean. So me, you won't kill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.92,0:34:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就可以一枪崩了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but her, you're just gonna blow away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆？- 麦迪逊 你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Madison. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.60,0:35:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不 不知道在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't-I don't-I don't know where I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.31,0:35:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有街道标志么？呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you see any street signs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.39,0:35:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 有 在米德尔 波因特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Middlepoint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 等我 麦迪 我们去找你 呆在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. Hold on, Maddy. We're coming to get you. Just stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.25,0:35:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.83,0:35:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我可能杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably killed someone last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.71,0:35:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.05,0:35:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way to know yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.76,0:35:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么别的办法能治好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something else we can try to make it go away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.43,0:35:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想出办法的 肯定在什么地方 会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find something. I mean, there's gotta be some answer, somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.64,0:35:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完全是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not entirely true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.56,0:35:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊 你应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison, you deserve to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.90,0:35:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们查过所有的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've scoured every source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.73,0:35:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是找不到让你复原的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just no cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.24,0:36:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is…? Is he right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.92,0:36:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许晚上可以把你关起来 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we could lock you up at night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.51,0:36:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会逃出来 总有一天你会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'd bust out, and some night you will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.30,0:36:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone else dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.06,0:36:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.53,0:36:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来就是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess that's all there is to it, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.82,0:36:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 别这么说 - 萨姆 我不想再伤害别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it. Don't talk like that. - Sam, I don't wanna hurt anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.91,0:36:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.54,0:36:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.75,0:37:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.93,0:37:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.13,0:37:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.34,0:37:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.47,0:37:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是个怪物 - 你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a monster. You don't have to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.89,0:37:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能找到办法的 好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can find a way, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.73,0:37:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能 我会救你的 - 你试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can. I'm gonna save you. - You tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.06,0:37:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.36,0:37:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all there is left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.36,0:37:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.66,0:37:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你来动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.62,0:37:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望是你 - 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want it to be you. - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.33,0:37:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.62,0:37:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不能这样活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't live like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.25,0:37:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你才能救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the way you can save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.68,0:37:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.51,0:37:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you to save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.24,0:38:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.62,0:39:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 不 你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - No, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.63,0:39:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 让我来 - 她要我去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy, I got this one. I'll do it. - She asked me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.72,0:39:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不用这样 - 必须我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have to. - Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.93,0:39:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.07,0:39:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait here.{\r}
